      "id": 25948,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Using a third-party service `GetResponse` used on the project and the 2FA deactivation functionality combined, a hacker found a way to send **arbitrary text** to **any** user, knowing only the victim's SteamID.\n\n*The vulnerability relied on:*\n1. Invalid cookie management in request;\n1. No additional validation for email ownership.",
